  "instruction_steps": [
    {
      "step_number": 1,
      "instruction": "Place all of the above ingredients into your roaster pan at least two days before you want to eat.  Stir occasionally throughout the days to distribute marinade evenly. Bake at a 350-degree oven for 1 hour to 1 1/2 hours or until meat is not red when sliced."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "You can also make these on skewers if you wish to go through the process of spearing the meat with other veggies to grill. Freezes well."
    }
  ],
